arlet Centurion, Scarlet Abbot, Scarlet Monk.\nStranglethorn Vale: Skullsplitter Hunter, Skullsplitter Witch Doctor, Bloodscalp Headhunter, Venture Co. Strip Miner, Mosh'Ogg Shaman, Shadowmaw Panther, Jungle Stalker, Lesser Water Elemental, Venture Co. Geologist, Snapjaw Crocolisk, Zanzil Witch Doctor, Ironjaw Basilisk, Elder Mistvale Gorilla, Bloodsail Swashbuckler, Elder Shadowmaw Panther, Naga Explorer, Jon-Jon the Crow.\nSwamp of Sorrows: Scalebane Captain, Marsh Murloc, Marsh Inkspewer, Sawtooth Snapper, Monstrous Crawler.\nThousand Needles: Rock Elemental.\nUldaman: Shadowforge Darkcaster, Stonevault Cave Lurker, Stonevault Rockchewer, Stonevault Brawler, Stonevault Mauler, Earthen Stonebreaker.\nlocation ID 1176 unresolved: Sandfury Shadowcaster, Sandfury Blood Drinker, Sandfury Witch Doctor, Sandfury Shadowhunter, Scarab, Zul'Farrak Dead Hero, Zul'Farrak Zombie, Sul'lithuz Sandcrawler.\nlocation ID 1477 unresolved: Nightmare Whelp.\nlocation ID 1584 unresolved: Anvilrage Overseer, Anvilrage Warden, Anvilrage Guardsman, Bloodhound, Dark Screecher.\nlocation ID 16 unresolved: Spitelash Myrmidon.\nlocation ID 2100 unresolved: Theradrim Shardling, Deep Borer, Putridus Satyr, Putridus Trickster, Poison Sprite, Corruptor, Constrictor Vine, Noxious Slime, Cavern Lurker, Deeprot Stomper, Deeprot Tangler, Subterranean Diemetradon, Stolid Snapjaw.\nlocation ID 28 unresolved: Skeletal Flayer.\nlocation ID 361 unresolved: Deadwood Gardener, Felpaw Wolf.\nlocation ID 4 unresolved: Black Slayer, Starving Snickerfang, Redstone Basilisk, Ashmane Boar.\nlocation ID 440 unresolved: Glasshide Basilisk, Glasshide Gazer, Starving Blisterpaw, Dunemaul Ogre, Dunemaul Brute, Wastewander Rogue, Wastewander Thief, Wastewander Shadow Mage, Wastewander Bandit, Wastewander Assassin, Southsea Pirate, Southsea Freebooter, Southsea Dock Worker, Southsea Swashbuckler, Steeljaw Snapper.\nlocation ID 47 unresolved: Vilebranch Soul Eater, Jade Ooze, Witherbark Broodguard, Highvale Outrunner, Highvale Scout, Vilebranch Warrior, Vilebranch Scalper.\nlocation ID 51 unresolved: Tempered War Golem, Glassweb Spider.\nPublished container alternatives: Steel Lockbox (#4637), Cuergo's Hidden Treasure (#9265), Lard's Special Picnic Basket (#19035), Emerald Encrusted Chest (#10752). Contents, opening requirements and current availability unverified; no guaranteed reward."},
