  [10011]={summary="Pattern: Stormcloth Gloves (#254682), Tailoring 185; published vendor references: Molkar — Desolace; Gorhak — Desolace (live stock/access unverified). Magram/Gelkis gate interpretation differs by source; see Guide. Also a published I Need a Tailor quest choice lead.",confidence="published-forever-recipe-vendor-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=254682",patternID=254682,recipeReference=true,details="Published book vendor/source references; current inventory/access unverified.\nMolkar (NPC 253140), Desolace; listed price 15 x Carved Centaur Totem (#254432); stock quantity unverified. Published map footprint: Desolace x 35.6–35.6, y 92–92. Stock, current access and prices remain live-unverified; map ranges are not a single waypoint or current sighting.\nGorhak (NPC 253139), Desolace; listed price 60 x Carved Centaur Totem (#254432); stock quantity unverified. Published map footprint: Desolace x 66.2–66.2, y 79.4–79.4. Stock, current access and prices remain live-unverified; map ranges are not a single waypoint or current sighting.\nExact book tooltip lists: Exalted with Magram Clan Centaur; Honored with Gelkis Clan Centaur. The source does not establish whether these are seller alternatives or cumulative purchase/learning conditions. A Friendly quest reward lead also exists; do not assume it bypasses learning requirements or that both standings must be obtained. Verify the current NPC/book requirements.\nAlternate published quest: I Need a Tailor (#92814), minimum level 30; choice reward: select this exact book. Quest page directs 1 White Bandit Mask to Molkar in Gelkis Village, Desolace; Friendly Gelkis objective. Quest-giver metadata/current access unverified. Quest delivery requirements are separate from crafting ingredients. Current access/prerequisites remain unverified."},
  [10025]={summary="Pattern: Shadoweave Mask (#10463), Tailoring 200; quest references: The Undermarket (#3402), Both factions, minimum quest level 40; start Nilith Lokrav (NPC 8439), Searing Gorge (published; current access/prerequisites unverified).",confidence="published-forever-quest-book-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10463",patternID=10463,recipeReference=true,details="These references track recipe books; separate direct-gear rewards are noted when exact quest metadata lists them. No live acquisition confirmed.\nThe Undermarket (#3402): start Nilith Lokrav (NPC 8439), Searing Gorge; turn in to Vizzklick (NPC 6568), Tanaris. Published reward: this exact book; Both factions; minimum quest level 40 (separate from gear equip level and book learning skill). Nilith Lokrav published map footprint: Searing Gorge x 40.8–41, y 74.4–74.8. Vizzklick published map footprint: Tanaris x 51–51, y 27.4–27.4. Current availability, prerequisites, specialisation access and completeness of the chain remain unverified. Map footprints are reference ranges, not current sightings or central waypoints."},
