  [10048]={summary="Pattern: Colorful Kilt (#10316), Tailoring 70; broad published book-drop table; location examples: Alterac Mountains, Ashenvale, Blackfathom Deeps; more named enemies/locations in Guide (live unverified; non-exhaustive references).",confidence="published-forever-book-drop-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10316",patternID=10316,recipeReference=true,details="Published recipe-book drop references; may retain historical data. No confirmed live drop, drop-rate claim or recommended fastest farm. This retrieved table contains 200 NPC rows and may be truncated; it is not a complete source inventory. These are sources for the learnable book, not finished crafted gear.\nAlterac Mountains: Vile Fin Lakestalker, Rot Hide Plague Weaver, Lake Skulker, Elder Lake Creeper, Cave Yeti.\nAshenvale: Forsaken Seeker, Forsaken Thug, Foulweald Warrior, Felmusk Felsworn, Shadethicket Moss Eater, Elder Ashenvale Bear, Spined Crawler, Shadowhorn Stag, Ghostpaw Howler, Thistlefur Ursa, Thistlefur Shaman, Laughing Sister, Fallenroot Satyr, Fallenroot Rogue, Blackfathom Tide Priestess, Blackfathom Oracle, Ashenvale Outrunner.\nBlackfathom Deeps: Fallenroot Shadowstalker, Blackfathom Sea Witch, Blackfathom Myrmidon, Twilight Acolyte, Twilight Reaver, Twilight Aquamancer, Twilight Loreseeker, Twilight Shadowmage, Twilight Elementalist, Murkshallow Snapclaw, Blindlight Murloc, Blindlight Oracle, Skittering Crustacean, Deep Pool Threshfin, Lady Sarevess.\nDarkshore: Stone Behemoth, Grizzled Thistle Bear, Stormscale Siren, Dark Strand Fanatic, Den Mother.\nDun Morogh: Addled Leper.\nDuskwood: Flesh Eater, Skeletal Warrior, Skeletal Horror, Skeletal Mage, Skeletal Fiend, Skeletal Healer, Young Black Ravager, Rotted One, Skeletal Raider.\nGnomeregan: Caverndeep Burrower, Caverndeep Ambusher, Leprous Defender, Leprous Machinesmith, Irradiated Pillager.\nHillsbrad Foothills: Cave Yeti, Syndicate Rogue, Hillsbrad Apprentice Blacksmith, Dun Garok Rifleman, Hillsbrad