  [254023]={summary="Pattern: Frothing Handwraps (#254024), Tailoring 165; 60 Merchant's Favor; published sellers: Alliance Mivin Shadowweave, Three Corners, Redridge Mountains; Horde Jim'bek, west of Crossroads, The Barrens. Tooltip: Friendly with this faction (live stock/gates unverified).",confidence="published-forever-recipe-vendor-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=254024",patternID=254024,recipeReference=true,details="Exact book tooltip: Tailoring 165 to learn; requires Friendly with this faction, without naming the faction. Camp guides identify Azeroth Commerce Authority for Alliance and Durotar Supply and Logistics for Horde; this is published context, not an independently confirmed current book-specific faction gate. No gate is inferred from cost or a similar pattern.\nAlliance seller: Mivin Shadowweave (NPC 256735), Three Corners, western Redridge Mountains. Horde seller: Jim'bek (NPC 248202), outside the west gate of the Crossroads in The Barrens. Both exact item tables list 60 Merchant's Favor (currency 3402). Stock quantity, current inventory and access remain unverified.\nPublished currency route: fill a Waylaid Crate with one requested material bundle; take the sealed crate to Marcy Baker at Three Corners (Alliance) or Dokimi outside the west gate of the Crossroads (Horde) for Merchant's Favor. Reputation is a separate requirement: the guide describes Craftsman's Writs, crafting the requested item and delivering it to the named customer. Consult the current crate/writ and vendor for requirements and rewards; no fixed grind, turn-in count or live availability is established."},
