  [276992]={summary="Plans: Cloudy Skyforged Chainmail (#276928), Blacksmithing 60; Honored with Nightclaw Druids. Published vendor: Vayn Moongaze, Nightclaw Cavern, Zephras Isle (shop access disputed; live unverified).",confidence="published-forever-recipe-vendor-reference",url="https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=276928",patternID=276928,recipeReference=true,details="Published book-specific requirement: Honored with Nightclaw Druids; Blacksmithing 60 to learn. Listed seller price 13s 15c; current price/discounts and stock quantity unverified.\nVayn Moongaze (NPC 254151): Nightclaw Cavern, Shadowgale Forest, northeast Zephras Isle. Published guide point 63.8, 36.0; NPC mapper spans x 63.3–64.1, y 36.0–38.1. These are reference positions, not a verified current sighting. A dated 8 November player comment reports no shop option; other comments report movement/disappearance. Current shop access is disputed and has not been independently checked.\nReputation route reference (published opening/ear quests require character level 8): Unnerving Silence (#94484), Lotheluum Starbreeze in Valanaar (guide point 64.0, 75.0), leads to Elegael Thornpaw (61.6, 39.2) and Shadowgale Forest quests. Vayn offers Mercy Falls on Deaf Ears (#93165); More Al'Aketh Ears (#93459) is a repeatable follow-up lead. Cultists are named in Shadowgale Forest, Shrine of Akir and Gustberry Lowlands. Quest pages disagree with guide/prose on ear quantities and opening-quest race access; do not assume every race can start this chain or predict a fixed grind. Consult the current quest log. No live drop-rate or guaranteed shop claim.\nTravel reference: skyboats from northern Dalaran or the cliffs south of Skywatcher Plateau near Thunder Bluff serve Valanaar. Published zone guide says non-Skyborne visitors can travel there; quest-chain access remains unresolved. No new race, class or equip restriction is imposed on the finished gear."},
